{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_title", "source_sha256": "ed0e32573faee11d4c0d387e130cedff8c05da1b10ddd2baa0f78c5a8e65a61d", "ja": "とおくとおくたかく", "zh": "飞向又高又远的地方", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_synopsis", "source_sha256": "baf471832f041cb8e305651c0f7373c99ebc3f9c9be00680148fe0f6f98e598d", "ja": "新曲として、初恋の歌を渡された美也。恋を\n知らないため、アイドル達へ聞き取り調査を\n開始する。自分なりに恋について学んだ美也\nは「プロデューサーに恋をしようと思う」と\n宣言して、仲間達を驚かせる。", "zh": "美也拿到了一首以初恋为主题的新歌。因为\n不了解恋爱，她开始向偶像们打听取经。用\n自己的方式学到了恋爱的美也宣称“我打算\n和制作人谈恋爱”，让同伴们大吃一惊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e57c27194cf191777d60ecea9df443df5e7d113fedd4f8d0703ff79b7c330988", "ja": "（新曲のため、美也が初恋をしてみると言い出した。\n……本人には、何か考えがあるみたいだ）", "zh": "（为了新歌，美也说要试着谈一场初恋。……她本人好像有什么想法。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1001_042miy", "source_sha256": "cc0182e63e67a406dfa8d412c663cb79a78ae35ff152350b008c7d472437876c", "ja": "それではさっそく『アイグラ！！』のアンケート取材を\n受けた人に、お話を聞きに行こうと思います～。", "zh": "那么接下来，我想去采访一下接受过《爱豆格拉！！》问卷采访的人～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1002_p", "source_sha256": "475f1dbfe92e54ed55328ed5a68f118611363b2c65afd0e2fe9ca2bd3357c8e3", "ja": "『アイグラ！！』のアンケート取材……\nそういえば、初恋についての質問があったな。", "zh": "《Idol Gravure！！》的问卷取材……\n说起来，里面确实有关于初恋的提问呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1003_042miy", "source_sha256": "1fcafb523d57dbd3b7a658367d5aa53dd79ff30b5e37ea4777a309f4e887f7ce", "ja": "はい～。いろんな人の初恋を聞いてみたら、\n何かわかるかもしれませんから～。", "zh": "对～。要是问问大家的初恋，说不定能了解到些什么呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1004_p", "source_sha256": "c80743608e27c965181b9e30f9b57a5e42a2ae9224b40a5f0502f22bc440e335", "ja": "確かに、悪くないアイディアだな。\nわかった、そういうことなら付き合うよ。", "zh": "确实，这个主意不错。\n好，既然这样，我就奉陪吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1005_042miy", "source_sha256": "7e9bed2bf03578744565f0da3c65f958c631a6c140aba70c7acc9404d250620b", "ja": "というわけで、まずはおふたりに聞かせてください～。\n春香さんと風花さんの初恋は、どんな人でしたか～？", "zh": "所以，首先请两位告诉我吧～  \n春香小姐和风花小姐的初恋对象，是怎样的人呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "cbddccf0f796da973b5b5c3f54a56dc4fa745d1b8c21d53020d2c62f53945cf7", "ja": "ええっ！？　ず、ずいぶん\nストレートな質問だね、美也ちゃん……。", "zh": "诶！？这、这问题也太直接了吧，美也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "66d2eec922c8e406429b5e999bc7205696d4e076688adeed7a428320d510e0b8", "ja": "この間はお話が途中で終わってしまいましたから。\nその続きを、と思いまして～。", "zh": "上次的谈话中途就结束了。所以我想，接着聊下去～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "97b7ac77dea522ed91723853b32248ddc55fc254d6f16eb15346ddf74a1b7537", "ja": "そういえば、そうだったね……。初恋かぁ……\n改めて口にするのって、なんだかその……。", "zh": "说起来，确实是这样呢……初恋啊……\n要重新说起这个，总觉得有点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ab042745c8ed4ab1d9bc3e67865cfe463e2523f143e3a53d2250126aebd84670", "ja": "……？　あ、気が付かなくて悪かった。\nプライベートな話だし、俺は席を外して……。", "zh": "……？　啊，不好意思，我刚才没注意到。\n既然是私事，那我先回避一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "05bb3f360eed66d7f206a3965ae6721b5d15e74aa692f393e70c3ff39a2e772f", "ja": "い、いえっ！　{$P$}さんに\n聞かせられないとか、そんなことありませんっ！", "zh": "不、不是的！完全没有不能让{$P$}先生\n听到的意思！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a1a683d3c15a9a0ce67c2f11705999032f335ada79979843353a0d189fd8436f", "ja": "だ、だよね……！　むしろ{$P$}さん\nには、聞いていただく責任があると思いますっ！", "zh": "对、对吧……！倒不如说，我觉得{$P$}先生有责任听一听才对！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1012_p", "source_sha256": "cd865f35c0d932e6821413704dc3ebb96ddfb9246ce110815fa964e43c03cf65", "ja": "責任……？　わ、わかった。\nとりあえず同席させてもらうよ。", "zh": "责任……？好、好吧。总之，我就一起参加吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "dd1ac23e2da0bb9d7ca1835c4098fcee546b9c234ab9aec601058c4417daa284", "ja": "それじゃ、話すね、その、私はやっぱり、優しい人……\nかなぁ。いざという時、頼りになって……。", "zh": "那我就说了哦，那个，我觉得还是温柔的人……吧。关键时刻又很可靠……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1014_041fuk", "source_sha256": "fdff18c3036f5426636590ae13c0cc69a68f187c704f924cc4305a354790643f", "ja": "私も、優しい人だなぁ……。あ、でも仕事は\nきちんとしていて、厳しいところは厳しくて……。", "zh": "我也觉得是个温柔的人呢……啊，不过工作时很认真，该严格的时候也很严格……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1015_042miy", "source_sha256": "ee271408496344100d8b0cff876de5adc0a6d98e6b754bfa4a2347a366f24de6", "ja": "ふむふむ……。おふたりは、優しい人を\n好きになったんですね～。勉強になりますよ～。", "zh": "嗯嗯……原来两位是喜欢上温柔的人了呀～真是让我学到了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1016_042miy", "source_sha256": "65b4281a6a0bb64f4d5b9f5c35cd68bc202df5df1a7296028f58096ca6098a8f", "ja": "わかりました、ありがとうございます～。\nそれではこの調子で、どんどん行きましょう～。", "zh": "明白了，谢谢您～  \n那么就照这个势头继续前进吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1017_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1018_042miy", "source_sha256": "97f5d39b0976e0c8e7d36eb50940e455cac5b2f5c4228cbc1711519f7d325302", "ja": "翼ちゃんは素敵な人、歌織さんは優しい人、\n琴葉ちゃんは、尊敬できる人……。", "zh": "翼是个很棒的人，歌织是个温柔的人，\n琴叶是个值得尊敬的人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1019_042miy", "source_sha256": "6d855daf81ca8b3431cc4996c60985a782ca1a4f48fce470d4d04f842dd03053", "ja": "みんなが協力してくれたおかげで、\nたくさん回答が集まりましたな～。", "zh": "多亏大家帮忙，收集到了好多回答呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1020_p", "source_sha256": "913e8be820851283ea1947d23874ab13bd392f1df45cb88916e266a1a3e875ad", "ja": "これでアンケート取材の経験者は、ほとんど\nまわったな……どうだ美也？　参考になりそうか？", "zh": "这样一来，几乎把有问卷采访经验的人都找过一遍了……美也，你觉得能派上用场吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1021_042miy", "source_sha256": "410cba965d2efd429e78df4246937e4e59b42daf0c10c978fb6946180db6a3fc", "ja": "そうですね～……。\nまだ、イメージが湧かないような……む～ん……。", "zh": "是呢～……\n还是有点想象不出来的感觉……唔～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1022_p", "source_sha256": "4aa5c50711179493515de23044db9c4c544087e665106f03ed9275c2f10e2acd", "ja": "そうか……初恋が、まだ美也の中にないものだとしたら\nいくら参考があっても難しいよな。", "zh": "这样啊……如果初恋还是美也心中尚不存在的东西，\n那再多的参考也很难啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1023_p", "source_sha256": "44a56716f7adc1e6c58a752370c47f7de9fbc4ec3e75df870350b4e6302e1070", "ja": "でも美也の歌なんだし、\n美也の考えた歌い方でいいと思うけど。", "zh": "不过这是美也的歌，\n我觉得用美也自己想出的唱法就可以了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1024_042miy", "source_sha256": "6aa0213d29c6bc602d1e44360c39635009e6df34bc85221bc5def9537f377b1d", "ja": "はい～。けど、初恋って、\nなかなか見つからないものなんですね～。", "zh": "是呀～不过，初恋这种东西，还真是不容易找到呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1025_p", "source_sha256": "099608664326ad4a1281f6c0f02a3162cbb71ec0bddcd090cb832aebb317e62c", "ja": "そうだな……見つけるというより、\nそばにあるものなのかもしれないな。", "zh": "是啊……与其说是去寻找，\n或许初恋就是在身边的东西吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1026_042miy", "source_sha256": "8e3479edc6b1deecf119a10d7689ff82cf0f972e264b3c96428e2251efad8810", "ja": "そばにあるもの……？", "zh": "是身边的东西……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1027_p", "source_sha256": "cf482fb4da7513d4d3ef71049da33456b29cdab59fc63362b406c66384b6db52", "ja": "恋って、相手がいて初めてできる事だろ？\nだから相手がいないと、難しいのかもしれないなって。", "zh": "恋爱这种事，总得有对象才能谈吧？\n所以我想，要是没有对象的话，或许就会很难呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1029_042miy", "source_sha256": "08ec2d1b8ef223c51c5ba27199c47a0fa9c07252e8e721ab52cebe4ceb188ca7", "ja": "相手がいて、初めてできること……。\nなるほど、大事なことを忘れていました～。", "zh": "有了对方，才能做到的事……。原来如此，我忘记了这么重要的事情～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1030_042miy", "source_sha256": "b494a4a8f5024d12937d6c267cd6ab23925c0c0b2575430227f111925dc21380", "ja": "たしかに、そのとおりですよ～。\n将棋も囲碁も、対局をするには相手が必要です～。", "zh": "确实，就是这样哦～\n不管是将棋还是围棋，要对局都需要对手～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1031_042miy", "source_sha256": "d763c4c0cd8dd7c156644ed658e0436028297918f51581eedf86c08198e9d91d", "ja": "{$P$}さん、ありがとうございます。\nひょっとしたら、掴めるかもしれませんよ～。むふふ。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，谢谢您。\n说不定，能抓住诀窍呢～。呵呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1032_p", "source_sha256": "fa0ccceb989bd692b1e05ba05d3491824a5d0f59a1b75e820b238a9251d8dd28", "ja": "美也……？", "zh": "美也……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1033_null", "source_sha256": "1be7f8066e0241eff012df67737f8580e21e64a834dee6e00681d9eff475651c", "ja": "翌日、ミーティング……", "zh": "隔天，会议……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1034_021mat", "source_sha256": "8958440a911ee6b295e3ae5b00474cc17038cb25525b7de908c2c4bd15eb8a68", "ja": "美也ちゃん。初恋の研究はどうなのです？\n何か成果はあったのです？", "zh": "美也。初恋研究得怎么样了？有什么成果吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1035_042miy", "source_sha256": "b5af7e61ef39ead36d57cabd157a31c17e888c92ca8c661b3748fc1f8c6aef19", "ja": "はい～。『アイグラ！！』のアンケート取材を\n受けた人に、話を聞きに行きましたよ～。", "zh": "是的～我去采访了接受《偶像写真！！》问卷调查的人，听他们聊了聊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1036_042miy", "source_sha256": "6ebcbc68e9f165d19261ff06f4b2de80e26d0cf7e2dad739521514aa5764b8bb", "ja": "そこで初恋について、{$P$}さんと\n一緒に、聞き取り調査をしました～。", "zh": "于是，我们和{$P$}先生一起，就初恋进行了访谈调查～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1037_044miz", "source_sha256": "c08f195aa5a863042e192f9d965e85787b70d44572ce2d128a5db6918c48f6df", "ja": "なるほど、回答済の人に……それならみなさん、\n答えがありますね。流石、宮尾さんです。", "zh": "原来如此，对于已经回答过的人……这样一来，大家都有答案了呢。不愧是宫尾小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1038_042miy", "source_sha256": "47a976794bfaa76e674e5cab9051c4c26b75dace31a7a6e1f116ed1efd50d3f0", "ja": "それから、恋は、相手がいないと\nできないことだというのも、わかりました～。", "zh": "然后，我也明白了，恋爱是没有对象就无法做到的事情～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1039_042miy", "source_sha256": "cbdca5c4fb613ca227f41c9a94894fb385daf561911d3c984f3164665ae945b9", "ja": "なので私は、{$P$}さんに\n初恋をしようかと思います～。", "zh": "所以我想在{$P$}先生时谈一场初恋～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1040_021mat", "source_sha256": "497e8a0483ff34f68151422c2fefa1e1e161c7fcc663e9541e0cde55b1854fe8", "ja": "なるほど、美也ちゃんが{$P$}さんに\n初恋を…………え？", "zh": "原来如此，美也要和{$P$}先生谈初恋……诶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1041_001har", "source_sha256": "7637c83304d76cc4218667b36c896d2c0e25cf338ad988de24d70109c93d53b5", "ja": "ええっと……今のは、聞き間違いじゃないよね？\n美也ちゃん、それはどういう……？", "zh": "那个……我没听错刚才的话吧？美也，你那是什么意思……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1042_042miy", "source_sha256": "d0b8f41fa5d374597a20937fa4ffc80e39add40e4b41f4be9be4c643a5127990", "ja": "はい～。聞き取り調査の結果と、いつも私のそばに\nいてくれるのは{$P$}さんなので……", "zh": "嗯～。根据询问调查的结果，平时一直陪在我身边的是{$P$}先生，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1043_042miy", "source_sha256": "8ea3c6cca63bd23a4d147402fcaef82ee43ce74e723fcf9146430ab15ccf50c8", "ja": "{$P$}さんを好きかもしれない、\nと思ったら、何だかそんな気がしてきたんですよ～。", "zh": "一想到自己可能喜欢{$P$}先生，\n不知怎的，就总觉得好像真是那样呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1044_041fuk", "source_sha256": "cc135f98843634cddcd22193a95f3fb58fc0db129efa8ba7bd703cd1de510c49", "ja": "そ、それは、あの……なにかの勘違いとか、\nそういう可能性もある、かも……？", "zh": "那、那个……也有可能是，什么误会之类的……对吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1045_021mat", "source_sha256": "8ce39b01623d628fb20b0f21fea9ab9c249d15bb724dff42fb5ce26b1647d43c", "ja": "そうなのです、美也ちゃん！　一番近くにいるからと\nいって、必ずその人が王子様になるわけでは……！", "zh": "就是这样， 美也！并不是因为那个人离自己最近，就一定会成为王子……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1046_042miy", "source_sha256": "4d2b5f806b45d4d6d939da1cd375e8c8e2e941bfe52d7a26a712bc26d9acccf7", "ja": "おや～？　私は、みなさんも同じかと\n思っていたのですが～……違うのでしょうか～。", "zh": "哎呀～？我还以为大家也都一样呢～……难道不是吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1051_044miz", "source_sha256": "47356c82f79edc7d9b5c661457933acb073de0cfbd5f612d45d1b8baca27380a", "ja": "宮尾さん……只者ではないと思っていましたが……。\n想像以上だぞ。", "zh": "宫尾小姐……虽然早就觉得你绝非等闲之辈……\n但也太超乎想象了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1052_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1053_p", "source_sha256": "5848669eb5719f41d938cfbe9ec392c21be463b7f35b0e7f4c7b7964b2a4c569", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま！\nおっ、なんだか盛り上がってるみたいだな。", "zh": "大家辛苦了！\n哦，感觉大家好像正热闹着呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1054_042miy", "source_sha256": "b28333e84077454a3d422bb8f4b1e18ba2bba02630160de3a0ada91cb0996aca", "ja": "はい～。実は私、{$P$}さんに、\n初恋をしようと思いまして～。", "zh": "是的～其实我打算在{$P$}先生谈一场初恋～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1055_p", "source_sha256": "1fc8f38532261c163862f1c3966f281296c03f0d822c00c73d4f53a6805c03c1", "ja": "…………え！？", "zh": "…………诶！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1056_001har", "source_sha256": "57354e60fa319f4c20d93f7f7b3c544811bc4b6c0ce561aa721a906588f727b0", "ja": "えっ、本人に言っちゃうの！？　っていうか、\n{$P$}さん、そうなんですか！？", "zh": "诶，要直接对本人说出来吗！？话说，{$P$}先生，原来是这样的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1057_021mat", "source_sha256": "a82eb4559c170e53a92bc1241fec3e48dfba19270a5a1f9037c9c8cbfe2f7fd1", "ja": "{$P$}さん。美也ちゃんとの恋バナ、\n姫にくわしく聞かせてほしいのです。……ね？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。你和美也的恋爱八卦，\n希望能详细跟公主讲讲呢。……好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1058_044miz", "source_sha256": "9f90699ee0ee9695b4a21a9ee177aa8d8c57c0e2759783e5a24fa6682c7f5ac7", "ja": "{$P$}。私も、ぜひ聞いてほしい話が\nあります。……できれば、今すぐ。", "zh": "{$P$}。我也有一件很想请您听听的事。……如果可以的话，就现在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1059_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8bf486c423d8daa8c842f60b09bb5c703ba0f766a479603c53b1abb0976d33fe", "ja": "あの……私は、信じてますよ……？\n{$P$}さんのこと……。", "zh": "那个……我相信您哦……？\n关于{$P$}先生的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1060_p", "source_sha256": "05501d411a6ed104b50dc1c68325d448daff427a9d7711819540f0845f356da7", "ja": "いやっ、ちょっと待ってくれ！\n何がどうなって、そんな話に……。", "zh": "不是，先等一下！\n怎么会变成这种说法啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1061_p", "source_sha256": "98c04ace7c9546d1fb5d8681d903f4ce0391ca13e924b0e16f9ada31afcd2722", "ja": "美也！　ちょっと、話をしよう！", "zh": "美也！等一下，我们谈谈吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1062_p", "source_sha256": "d84b87554b3aa5cea12519cafdc41c85fb86ec054b1a67b6869f49eccdf617c3", "ja": "（劇場の中だと騒がしいので、外に出た。\nそれにしても驚いた……）", "zh": "（因为在剧场里太吵了，所以出来到外面了。话说回来，真让人吃惊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1063_042miy", "source_sha256": "7938f4be7f6370f34658ff1612e4f952f7bc287c4c5ddbdc7c4883d9143fbac9", "ja": "何だか、騒ぎになってしまいましたね～。\nすみません、{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "不知不觉间，好像闹出骚动了呢～。\n对不起，{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1064_p", "source_sha256": "eb44368f648d8b4c44b7d56d1ae7deec3741f5f8800fe8e68c2c61b0d29fb387", "ja": "そ、そうだな……。しかし美也、\nどうして初恋相手を俺にしようと思ったんだ？", "zh": "是、是啊……不过美也，你为什么会想把我当成初恋对象？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1065_042miy", "source_sha256": "11d77a4b728e2e7f9a2f2cad23bc3dc8a5fa8f3e2eb972895d79169865b38a11", "ja": "はい～。聞き取り調査の結果です～。優しくて仕事が\nできて、尊敬できて、いつもそばにいてくれる……。", "zh": "嗯～这是调查询问的结果～。温柔、能干、值得尊敬，而且总是陪在身边……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1066_042miy", "source_sha256": "f427ba7c00c9beb9b33cb1fcfcd7062cf4bfcc9a83eac7adadcb79a8a7c2e3b5", "ja": "私の周りで該当する人は、\n{$P$}さんしかいません～。", "zh": "在我身边符合这些条件的人，只有{$P$}先生～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1067_042miy", "source_sha256": "9860d46d2589fe167abe50dd1354235933875b8e7eba6d6e4a72981e23cf34ad", "ja": "何より、いつも大事なことを教えてくれるのは、\n{$P$}さんですから～。", "zh": "最重要的是，一直教会我重要事情的就是{$P$}先生了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1068_p", "source_sha256": "f82930ad3c8f73a2c0ee6a9fe9e62afa9c71f45b8f20e56f12930b68247e0fa1", "ja": "大事なこと？", "zh": "重要的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1069_042miy", "source_sha256": "84f53e2c850a890dd881ea0897808882e55d82b4e7781cf7610cbf50c7d49412", "ja": "はい～。今回も、恋はひとりではできない、\nということを教えてもらいましたよ～。", "zh": "是的～这次也让我明白了，恋爱不是一个人就能谈的哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1070_p", "source_sha256": "c3e4b1ec24a93ccabfe088d96f39a23062c139c0556175d318e5063ff842390c", "ja": "それは……。\n確かに言ったな……。", "zh": "这个嘛……我确实说过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1071_042miy", "source_sha256": "800b484cfab38994200e636019c1199f2cba2ed7a7661b678630988414cd2dc6", "ja": "{$P$}さんに教えてもらうと、\n私の目から、ウロコが落ちるんですな～。", "zh": "只要得到{$P$}先生的指点，\n我就会有种恍然大悟ROCO的感觉呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1072_042miy", "source_sha256": "c16aadfb0401833a4c57de849f77f414df09f3ffc08117df14d15a6c442c0002", "ja": "まるで、世界が新しくなるみたいに～……。\n今までにも、何度もそういう事がありましたから～。", "zh": "就像整个世界都焕然一新了一样～……\n毕竟以前也有过很多次这样的体验了呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1073_p", "source_sha256": "e4fdba82449cb7f3ad590af3a993317ab00ce4149ce595111a0d13093d058f93", "ja": "そうか……。", "zh": "是吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1074_p", "source_sha256": "920cfff86ba42c21084063ccf85a1dfbec65d4273d98bfe217b9d9efd0e3f6a0", "ja": "（美也なりに真面目に考えた結果なんだろう。\n無下にはできない、とはいえ……）", "zh": "（这应该是美也认真思考后得出的结果吧。\n虽然不能无情地拒绝她，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1075_042miy", "source_sha256": "a443728a8175b991932eba7c1377a7feb90b5c05a89ee687339a5281a0ed75e9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1076_042miy", "source_sha256": "f3f63d673a5ced9934eedf3ffd7756253dd3381b506efa36e687cf8bea78bb63", "ja": "もしかして……私が{$P$}さんを\n好きだと、困りますか～……？", "zh": "难道说……要是美也\n喜欢{$P$}先生的话，会让您很困扰吗～……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1077_p", "source_sha256": "b7117568a60c8a601c7475c1f1d39efc1a3f67517d9d13ee82cc77293f2875c6", "ja": "そうだな……美也とは、アイドルと\nプロデューサーという関係だし。恋は難しいかな……。", "zh": "是啊……毕竟我和美也是偶像与制作人的关系。要谈恋爱，可能有点难吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1078_042miy", "source_sha256": "ebc7ecb849e12fc9e46553952d3243abde67c84fe0b734ce1492a7df2fc4adb7", "ja": "そうなんですね～……。", "zh": "原来是这样呢～……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1079_042miy", "source_sha256": "2303b0c779f934ad71c2068f770397316395fd12074e99ad41e636e325930cbb", "ja": "やっぱり、{$P$}さんに恋をするのは\nやめたほうがいいんでしょうか～……。", "zh": "果然，还是不要爱上{$P$}先生比较好吧～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1080_p", "source_sha256": "d006da7f9887b4c01f5f037332c349f496517296bb6db05624084a1dbaa7bb63", "ja": "美也が、美也なりに……\n真剣に考えた結果だというのは、わかるよ。", "zh": "我明白，这是美也以美也的方式……认真思考后得出的结果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1082_p", "source_sha256": "cb4b698aa5b92cbad8380d78958616e7a29484f3229a3a3eac5ee081cfb55dad", "ja": "でもそれは、美也が新曲を歌う必要にかられて……\n俺に「恋をしよう」と思ってしたものだしな……。", "zh": "可是，那是因为美也觉得有必要唱新歌……才想着要和我“谈恋爱”，并以此为前提去做的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1083_p", "source_sha256": "092eb80bae64724e2904fbf266f3260d7f3b3554dc59c6ff9e0f83ebc32a5723", "ja": "だから無理に、「これが初恋だ」なんて\n思うようにしなくてもいいんじゃないかな？", "zh": "所以，也不用勉强自己去想“这就是初恋”吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1084_p", "source_sha256": "95f00bac5e5139f402f8b6e4e66785fd6ab62b221549b1224bf6fdf2539a1c81", "ja": "もっとも、恋は人の気持ちだから。何が本物で本物じゃ\nないかなんて、俺が決める事ではないけど……。", "zh": "不过，恋爱毕竟是人的心意。什么是真、什么不是\n真，并不是由我来决定的就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1085_042miy", "source_sha256": "bee56c1800b2a3af7db8901ca769f391c5c7dc02e83bb8bc0a862426def72c96", "ja": "本物かどうか……。", "zh": "是否是真实的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1086_p", "source_sha256": "a6dee1726484a056fddb47c640833ca4786c6fdc53fd60b7132a660fadd04185", "ja": "それが本物の恋であるかどうかより、美也が\n感じている気持ちの方が、大事なものだと思う。", "zh": "比起那是否是真正的恋爱，我觉得美也感受到的心情才更加重要。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1087_042miy", "source_sha256": "0eed429a86d435268c3eff5bd5e6f6509e6244ddc2844530a6453ac234c4f267", "ja": "……{$P$}さん。\nではひとつ、お願いを聞いてくれますか～？", "zh": "……{$P$}先生。\n那您可以答应我一个小小的请求吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1088_042miy", "source_sha256": "dd8874903b958f42cd30f6f6a0a7083cd90ba9e5812c01ff8ea8aa98bdbe5cab", "ja": "10年後の私が、やっぱり\n{$P$}さんのことを好きだったら……", "zh": "如果10年后的我，还是\n喜欢着{$P$}先生的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1089_042miy", "source_sha256": "54b24384600b9085d49b1abd63c9f60bc009dbb25564b600aeb3b92ddf1b0bbf", "ja": "その時は、告白をしてもいいですか～？", "zh": "到那时候，我可以向您告白吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1090_p", "source_sha256": "60925dab42753a6d95692123ea2f22c9e666576f07dbceff183333acc47d5f62", "ja": "10年後か……その頃の俺がどうなっているのか、\n保証はできないけど……。", "zh": "10年后啊……到那时候我会变成什么样，\n虽然没法保证……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1091_042miy", "source_sha256": "201ee06f9e1493cba51cb969275f0af7e45e55aa120318f2938daaa384cef880", "ja": "それはお互い様ですよ～。ふふふ。\nお話してくれて、ありがとうございます～。", "zh": "彼此彼此哦～呵呵。\n谢谢你愿意告诉我～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1092_p", "source_sha256": "b644d0ad6e9fdd703dd47a0bfd03315d1bf200cd69d5d5f820eb735c104ba863", "ja": "いや、こちらこそ。きちんと考えたつもりだけど、\n答えになってるかどうか……。", "zh": "哪里，我才该说谢谢。虽然我是认真思考过了，\n但不知道有没有回答到点子上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1093_042miy", "source_sha256": "f412579280f4ada65dcf3e64b336f2e3b845fa2332ea0ebd6e073b1ed508e433", "ja": "私は、とってもうれしかったですよ～。……それでは、\nそろそろ、みんなのところへ戻りましょう～。", "zh": "我真的非常开心哦～……那么，我们差不多该回大家那里去了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_085_1094_042miy", "source_sha256": "41d6324a8689a3a93dce27d4bffb5cdc59e870b928e944e95fa20de01bb60232", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\n新曲お披露目公演、がんばりましょうね～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n新曲公开演出，要一起加油哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
